12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt29921437:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Cosas Vacías","overview":"La popularidad de Ashur en Capua se dispara a un alto precio.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h5IMRZhmJv9WDH5nUMzA0WYxSjo.jpg","released":"2026-01-02T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"59 min"},{"id":"tt29921437:1:7","season":1,"episode":7,"title":"La Herida más profunda","overview":"Korris exige sangre. Ashur intenta convencer a un enemigo para que se una a su causa.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uww4j9MYWAYx1N5qlYDiTgf9PM3.jpg","released":"2026-01-09T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"60 min"},{"id":"tt29921437:1:8","season":1,"episode":8,"title":"Horizontes","overview":"Achillia prepara su regreso a la arena mientras Ashur se enfrenta a un contratiempo devastador.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oqmpIETb0JaFBxlsPF5PTWkgRmI.jpg","released":"2026-01-23T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"61 min"},{"id":"tt29921437:1:9","season":1,"episode":9,"title":"Aquellos Que Permanecen","overview":"César exige un doloroso sacrificio a Ashur.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pW0mO7LWFVCmy8WIa1Peveg04Ol.jpg","released":"2026-01-30T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"54 min"},{"id":"tt29921437:1:10","season":1,"episode":10,"title":"Ave, César","overview":"Achillia regresa a la arena para enfrentarse a su mayor reto mientras Ashur lucha con las consecuencias emocionales de sus actos.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/doaBxNchToYNiBGIrzmDsljw55L.jpg","released":"2026-02-06T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"66 min"}]}}